<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God needs some young people,</l><l>To keep themselves from defilement;</l><l>Some who will stand against the current of the age,</l><l>Who will declare, Lord, from today</l><l>We’re going to flee youthful lusts and pursue</l><l>righteousness with the view—</l><l>The building of the church.</l><l>Not wasting time,</l><l>Pressing on toward the goal,</l><l>Occupied with the prize,</l><l>Oh Lord, we’ve been wrecked, we’ll build Your church!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
